          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Tennessee Secondary School Athletic Association (Petitioner), according to Tennessee Secondary School Athletic Association (Petitioner), the petitioner argues that the TSSAA has broad discretion to adopt and enforce contractual restrictions on athletic recruiting as a condition of membership."
