            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to James B. Blumstein (respondent), according to James B. Blumstein (respondent), the respondent contends that the case raises First Amendment, student, parent, and procedural due\u2011process interests."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
